<title>USA: First American Health names Kiser CFO.</title>
<headline>First American Health names Kiser CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First American Health Concepts Inc said Tuesday it named Richard Kiser vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The position was previously vacant.</p>
<p>Kiser has was vice president of managed care at Physician's Eye Care Network.</p>
